{
  "$schema": "is-preview/v1",
  "tag": "is-block-layout",
  "category": "isp",
  "title": "<is-block-layout>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "styles": ".bl-title { font-size: calc(1rem + var(--lerpw, 0) * 0.75rem); margin: 0; }\r\n    is-block-layout[data-szw-lg] .bl-title { font-weight: 700; }",
  "storageKey": "docs-is-block-layout",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-block-layout>",
      "lede": "Caja de bloque que mide su propio ancho y publica el breakpoint como\r\n          <code class=\"code\">data-sizew</code>, banderas <code class=\"code\">data-szw-*</code> y las custom properties\r\n          <code class=\"code\">--clientw</code> / <code class=\"code\">--lerpw</code>. Port del <code class=\"code\">BlockLayout.svelte</code> de ISP.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-block-layout id=\"bl-intro\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--is-border);padding:1rem;resize:horizontal;overflow:auto;min-width:180px\">\r\n            <p>Redimensiona esta caja tirando de la esquina inferior derecha.</p>\r\n            <p>sizew actual: <strong id=\"bl-out\">—</strong></p>\r\n          </is-block-layout>",
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:inline",
              "label": "inline"
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:cscroll",
              "label": "cscroll"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "examples",
      "title": "Breakpoint como atributo y como variable",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>El atributo <code class=\"code\">data-sizew</code> se puede estilar desde el light DOM, y\r\n          <code class=\"code\">--lerpw</code> se puede interpolar con <code class=\"code\">calc()</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-block-layout class=\"bl-demo\" style=\"border:1px dashed var(--is-border);padding:1rem;resize:horizontal;overflow:auto;min-width:180px\">\r\n            <p class=\"bl-title\">Título que crece con el ancho del contenedor</p>\r\n          </is-block-layout>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<is-block-layout>…</is-block-layout>\n\n/* light DOM */\nis-block-layout[data-szw-lg] .bl-title { font-weight: 700; }\n.bl-title { font-size: calc(1rem + var(--lerpw, 0) * 0.75rem); }"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<is-heading level=\"2\">Inline y scroll</is-heading>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-block-layout inline style=\"border:1px solid var(--is-border);padding:0.5rem 1rem\">inline</is-block-layout>\r\n          <is-block-layout inline style=\"border:1px solid var(--is-border);padding:0.5rem 1rem\">otro inline</is-block-layout>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-block-layout cscroll style=\"border:1px solid var(--is-border);padding:1rem;max-height:6rem;width:100%\">\r\n            <p>Con <code class=\"code\">cscroll</code> la caja hace scroll con el scrollbar del tema.</p>\r\n            <p>Línea 2</p><p>Línea 3</p><p>Línea 4</p><p>Línea 5</p><p>Línea 6</p>\r\n          </is-block-layout>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "json",
      "title": "json2html · html2json",
      "lede": "El cuerpo se define en JSON compacto <code class=\"code\">[tag, attrs?, …hijos]</code>\n          (mismo codec que <code class=\"code\">&lt;is-form&gt;</code>).",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-block-layout id=\"blJson\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--is-border);padding:1rem;min-height:6rem\"></is-block-layout>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.5rem;margin:0.75rem 0\">\n            <is-button id=\"blBtnToJson\" variant=\"outlined\" color=\"neutral\">html2json()</is-button>\n            <is-button id=\"blBtnFromJson\" color=\"brand\">fromJSON(body)</is-button>\n          </div>\n          <pre id=\"blJsonOut\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0.65rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid var(--is-border);border-radius:0.5rem;background:var(--is-bg-elev);font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:0.75rem;white-space:pre-wrap;max-height:12rem;overflow:auto\"></pre>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "block.fromJSON({\n  body: [\n    ['p', 'Hola desde JSON'],\n    ['is-text', { color: 'neutral' }, 'secundario'],\n  ],\n});\nblock.html2json();",
          "lang": "js"
        }
      ]
    },
